    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im talking to you. everything just feels so heavy lately. i spend all day looking at my dad, and he isnt even really \"there\" anymore, he just stares. and i just feel like i'm rotting away with him. like i'm just waiting for the end of everything.",
